WEBVTT

00:06:29.525 --> 00:06:31.876
morajo biti naši lastni standardi,

00:06:31.876 --> 00:06:35.615
ne tisti, ki jih določi cenzor ali zakon,

00:06:35.615 --> 00:06:37.438
lastni standardi in lastna integriteta.

00:06:37.438 --> 00:06:39.432
Naša integriteta, ko

00:06:39.432 --> 00:06:40.980
delamo z drugimi

00:06:40.980 --> 00:06:44.605
in naši standardi, ko delujemo v družbi.

00:06:44.605 --> 00:06:46.075
Ti naši standardi

00:06:46.075 --> 00:06:49.340
morajo biti del
trajnostne družbene agende.

00:06:49.340 --> 00:06:51.453
So del kolektivne odgovornosti,

00:06:51.453 --> 00:06:53.583
odgovornosti umetnika ali novinarja,

00:06:53.583 --> 00:06:55.957
da pokaže svet, kakršen je,

00:06:55.957 --> 00:06:58.406
to pa mora iti z roko v roki

00:06:58.406 --> 00:07:00.824
z odgovornostjo tistih, ki vodijo družbo,